		<defName>MakeAmmo_Slugthrower_ElectroSlug</defName>
		<label>make slugthrower (Electro-Slug) shell x40</label>
		<description>Craft 40 slugthrower (Electro-Slug) shells.</description>
		<jobString>Making slugthrower (Electro-Slug) shells.</jobString>
